/ScaleFont{dup fmc 0 get Amul 0 exch put dup dup 3 get Amul 3 exch put fmd}bd
/SlantFont{fmc 2 get dup 0 eq{pop 1}if Amul FontMatrix 0 get mul 2 exch put fmd}bd
